      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm helping out with the city council newsletter and need to put together a section about the upcoming congestion pricing vote. i have some notes but i need you to help me turn them into a professional and engaging paragraph for the residents. \n\nhere's the info:\n- vote is this tuesday\n- goal is to reduce downtown traffic and lower emissions\n- some local business owners are worried about the cost for customers/delivery\n- it's part of the city's \"Green Transit initiative\"\n\ncan you draft a paragraph for the newsletter based on that?",
