      "content": "thanks. it sounds okay but i feel like it's a bit too \"pro-plan.\" the business owners are actually pretty upset and saying it's basically a tax on anyone who doesn't live right next to downtown.\n\ncan you try another version that sounds a bit more balanced? maybe emphasize the economic concerns more so people don't feel like the council is just ignoring them?",
